1.0.1 23oct26
* Continuation of tkeffer/weewx-time_since.
* Added install.py, so the extension installs with weectl extension install.
* The module VERSION was 0.4 and is now in step with this file.
* The docstring example used $time_since() without long_form, which renders as seconds.
* Added tests and a justfile. README.md follows the weewx-packages schema.

